# playwright
/test-results
/playwright-report

# ancestry-resolution research byproducts
# Reference allele frequencies fetched at run time, and the rows a measurement
# writes as it goes. Deliberately untracked: reference data enters this
# repository through a licence audit (docs/dataset-licenses.md), not through a
# research script, and `gate:secrets` only sees the tracked tree — so an
# accidental `git add -A` is exactly how a large reference dump would arrive
# without one.
scripts/ancestry-resolution/gnomad-pops.json
scripts/ancestry-resolution/naming-rule-rows.jsonl
scripts/ancestry-resolution/hgdp-tgp-freqs.json
scripts/ancestry-resolution/hgdp-tgp-populations.json
scripts/ancestry-resolution/__pycache__/
